msgstr "将限制上升高度以避开接缝"

#: properties.py:139
msgid "Rotate which sector is gore 1 (degrees, counter-clockwise from +X seen from above), to align the start with a landmark on the object. Fitted mode only"
msgstr "旋转以改变哪个扇区作为拼片 1（度，俯视时从 +X 轴逆时针），使起点与物体上的标记对齐。仅限拟合模式"

#: properties.py:230
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋转"

#: operators.py:381
msgid "Run Preview first to read dimensions."
msgstr "请先运行预览以读取尺寸。"

