msgstr "接缝偏移（毫米）"

#: properties.py:172
msgid "Seamless (tileable) pattern as an SVG file"
msgstr "无缝（可平铺）图案的 SVG 文件"

#: properties.py:205
msgid "Search for a placement that leaves fewer defects: small or disconnected pieces of material"
msgstr "搜索产生更少缺陷的放置方式：细小或断开的材料碎片"

