msgstr "条带"

#: properties.py:194
msgid "Treat the pattern's filled shapes as the holes and everything around them as material. The cut is the same either way; this is what the placement search and the defects layer measure"
msgstr "将图案的填充形状视为孔洞，其周围的一切视为材料。两种方式的切割结果相同；放置搜索和缺陷图层以此为判定依据"

#: ui.py:234
msgid "Turn on Fill With Pattern"
msgstr "启用「用图案填充」"

#: properties.py:297
msgid "Vertical drop on the object; a domed or flared top covers more surface than height, and the cut follows accordingly"
msgstr "物体上的垂直落差；穹顶或外扩的顶部覆盖的表面大于高度，切割会相应调整"

#: properties.py:249
msgid "Visual"
msgstr "视觉"

#: properties.py:167
msgid "Warp a seamless vector pattern to fill each gore, added as a separate layer in the exported SVG"
msgstr "变形无缝矢量图案以填充每个拼片，作为单独图层添加到导出的 SVG 中"

